OL,3,AAt least 30 killed in Spanish high
OL,4,Aspeed train crash with dozens seriously
OL,5,Ainjured, regional leader says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 30 people have been killed,
OL,8,Faccording to regional officials, after
OL,9,Fa Spanish high-speed train collided
OL,10,Fwith another train south of the capital
OL,11,FMadrid - here's what we know so far
OL,13,FMore than 500 passengers were
OL,14,Ftravelling on the trains involved, the
OL,15,Fspokesperson for the regional
OL,16,Fgovernment says
OL,18,FSpain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,19,Fsays he is "shocked by the serious
OL,20,Ftrain accident" and is in constant
OL,21,Fcontact with the transport minister
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
